El arco y las flechas de Susan.
162
00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:11.151
Люси.
163
00:10:13.196 --> 00:10:14.947
Mi curación samimiy...
164
00:10:15.282 --> 00:10:16.699
даа.
165
00:10:16.866 --> 00:10:18.200
Өө, уу?
166
